                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "God help you if you forget where you're supposed to go in this game. There's no in-game quest log or journal, and wandering around trying to find it might take forever, because every time you re-enter an area all the random enemies respawn and make a beeline for you at breakneck speed to engage you in inescapable battle.\n\nIt's also a generic, typo-ridden RPG plot made with generic stock assets, but that just makes it dull. The respawning enemies make it excruciating.",
